{
    "title": "Coin Car Games: Simulator",
    "description": "Experience the most relaxing and fun car games with your Facebook friends \r\nand use your skills to renovate old cars!- Every time you start this car game, it's a win!\r\n Through a variety of gameplay, you can obtain various lucky fortunes, which \r\nmay include large amounts of gold coins, shields, bonus gameplay, attack or \r\nraid gameplay. You can embark on a journey to restore your car and bring it \r\nback to life. Victory Shield protects your car from damage. Start the game to \r\nget more lucky fortune and unlock more cars!- Attack or raid for more wealth!\r\n Attack cars or raid garages, all methods help get more coins! Prosperity! \r\nBecome an Avenger, crash the car hard and take back everything that belongs \r\nto you! Attack with all your strength! Search for treasure in a huge garage, it's \r\nhard to tell where the legendary treasure will appear!-Various classic cars are waiting for you!\r\n Keep your car spotless\r\n Repair damaged car parts\r\n Give them a fresh coat of paint\r\n Replace parts to keep them looking like new\r\n Check your car's performance and complete parking & driving challenges.\r\n Compete against players in the multiplayer racing.\r\n There\u2019s more to come in future updates! More gameplay and more fun, \r\nadvanced vehicles to play with!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Experience the most relaxing and fun car games with your Facebook friends <br>and use your skills to renovate old cars!- Every time you start this car game, it&#39;s a win!<br> Through a variety of gameplay, you can obtain various lucky fortunes, which <br>may include large amounts of gold coins, shields, bonus gameplay, attack or <br>raid gameplay. You can embark on a journey to restore your car and bring it <br>back to life. Victory Shield protects your car from damage. Start the game to <br>get more lucky fortune and unlock more cars!- Attack or raid for more wealth!<br> Attack cars or raid garages, all methods help get more coins! Prosperity! <br>Become an Avenger, crash the car hard and take back everything that belongs <br>to you! Attack with all your strength! Search for treasure in a huge garage, it&#39;s <br>hard to tell where the legendary treasure will appear!-Various classic cars are waiting for you!<br> Keep your car spotless<br> Repair damaged car parts<br> Give them a fresh coat of paint<br> Replace parts to keep them looking like new<br> Check your car&#39;s performance and complete parking &amp; driving challenges.<br> Compete against players in the multiplayer racing.<br> There\u2019s more to come in future updates! More gameplay and more fun, <br>advanced vehicles to play with!",
